      "markdown": "**Step 5: Ergodic Coverage.** Moreover, under Assumption 6, each energy layer in the relevant range is itself a unique ergodic component. Since Supp( _K_ ) intersects every energy level in [ _H_ 1 _, H_ 2], Condition 3 of Theorem 2 also holds.",
